<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="RUT" style="id">- Biblica® Open Asante Twi Contemporary Bible 2020</book>
  <para style="h">Rut</para>
  <para style="toc1">Rut Nwoma</para>
  <para style="toc2">Rut</para>
  <para style="toc3">Rut</para>
  <para style="mt1">Rut Nwoma</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="RUT 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Elimelek Tutu Kɔtena Moab</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 1:1"/>Ɛberɛ a na atemmufoɔ di Israel so no, ɛkɔm baa asase no so. Ɔbarima bi a ɔfiri Betlehem wɔ Yuda ne ne yere ne ne mmammarima baanu tutu firii asase no so kɔtenaa Moab. <verse eid="RUT 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 1:2"/>Na ɔbarima no din de Elimelek<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wɔnyaa edin Efrati firii abusua a Elimelek firi mu no. Ɛno enti, Elimelek de nʼabusua din no too ɔmantam a ɛbɛn Betlehem a ɛtɔ da a wɔfrɛ no Betlehem Efrati no (<char style="xt"><ref loc="RUT 4:11">4.11</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 35:19">1 Mose 35.19</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 17:12">1 Sam 17.12</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 5:2">Mika 5.2</ref></char>).</char></note> ɛnna ne yere nso din de Naomi. Ne mmammarima baanu no nso, na wɔn din de Mahlon ne Kilion. Wɔyɛ Efratifoɔ a wɔfiri Betlehem wɔ Yuda. Wɔkɔɔ Moab kɔtenaa hɔ. <verse eid="RUT 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 1:3"/>Ɛbaa sɛ Naomi kunu Elimelek wuiɛ ma ɛkaa ne mmammarima baanu no. <verse eid="RUT 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 1:4"/>Wɔwarewaree Moabfoɔ mmaa. Na ɔbaako din de Orpa na deɛ ɔka ho no nso din de Rut. Wɔtenaa hɔ bɛyɛ sɛ mfeɛ edu no, <verse eid="RUT 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 1:5"/>Mahlon ne Kilion nso wuwuiɛ. Enti, ɛmaa Naomi tenaa ase a wahwere ne mmammarima baanu no ne ne kunu.<verse eid="RUT 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 1:6"/>Ɛberɛ a ɔtee wɔ Moab hɔ sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> abɛdom ne nkurɔfoɔ a wɔwɔ Yuda na wama wɔn aduane no, Naomi ne ne nsenom yi yɛɛ ahoboa sɛ wɔrefiri Moab asane akɔ ne kurom. <verse eid="RUT 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 1:7"/>Ɔne ne nsenom baanu yi tutu firii beaeɛ hɔ faa ɛkwan a ɛde wɔn bɛkɔ akɔsi Yuda so.<verse eid="RUT 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 1:8"/>Afei, Naomi ka kyerɛɛ ne nsenom yi sɛ, “Monsane nkɔ mo maamenom fie. <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ne mo nni no yie sɛdeɛ mo ne awufoɔ ne me dii no yie no. <verse eid="RUT 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 1:9"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> mmoa mo mu biara na ɔnnya ɔhome wɔ okunu foforɔ fie.” Afei, ɔfefee wɔn ano na wɔn nyinaa maa wɔn nne so suiɛ.<verse eid="RUT 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 1:10"/>Na wɔka kyerɛɛ Naomi sɛ, “Yɛne wo bɛsane akɔ wo nkurɔfoɔ nkyɛn.”<verse eid="RUT 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 1:11"/>Nanso, Naomi kaa sɛ, “Me mma, monsane nkɔ fie. Adɛn enti na ɛsɛ sɛ mo ne me kɔ? Merekɔwo mmammarima bio a wɔbɛtumi awareware mo anaa? <verse eid="RUT 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 1:12"/>Me mma, monsane nkɔ fie. Manyini, sɛ meware kunu bio a, ɛrenyɛ yie. Mpo, sɛ medwene sɛ anidasoɔ bi wɔ hɔ ma me sɛ nso anadwo yi ara mɛnya kunu na me ne no wo mmammarima a, <verse eid="RUT 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 1:13"/>mobɛtwɛn kɔsi sɛ wɔbɛnyinyini? Mobɛtena atwɛn wɔn anaa? Dabi, me mma. Asɛm no yɛ den ma me sen mo, ɛfiri sɛ, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ayi ne nsa afiri me so!”<verse eid="RUT 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 1:14"/>Wɔsane twaa adwo bio. Afei, Orpa fee nʼase ano de gyaa no kwan, nanso Rut bebaree Naomi sɛ ɔne no bɛtena.<verse eid="RUT 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 1:15"/>Nanso, Naomi ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Hwɛ, wo kora asane kɔ ne nkurɔfoɔ ne nʼanyame nkyɛn. Ɛsɛ sɛ wo nso woyɛ saa ara.”<verse eid="RUT 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 1:16"/>Na Rut buaa sɛ, “Nhyɛ me sɛ memfiri wo nkyɛn nsane nkɔ. Baabiara a wobɛkɔ no, mɛkɔ hɔ bi na baabiara a wobɛtena no nso, mɛtena hɔ bi. Wo nkurɔfoɔ bɛyɛ me nkurɔfoɔ na wo Onyankopɔn ayɛ me Onyankopɔn. <verse eid="RUT 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 1:17"/>Baabi a wobɛwuo no, mɛwu hɔ bi na wɔasie me hɔ. Sɛ mamma owuo antete me ne wo ntam na ɛnam biribi foforɔ biara so a, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ntwe mʼaso.” <verse eid="RUT 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 1:18"/>Enti, Naomi hunuu sɛ Rut ayɛ nʼadwene sɛ ɔne no bɛkɔ no, ɔgyaa ne pɛ maa no.<verse eid="RUT 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 1:19"/>Ɛno enti, wɔn baanu no toaa wɔn akwantuo no so. Ɛberɛ a wɔduruu Betlehem no, wɔn enti kuro mu no nyinaa bɔɔ twi. Mmaa no bisaa sɛ, “Naomi nie anaa?”<verse eid="RUT 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 1:20"/>Ɔkaa sɛ, “Mommfrɛ me Naomi, na mmom, momfrɛ me Mara, ɛfiri sɛ, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ama asetena ayɛ nwono ama me. <verse eid="RUT 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 1:21"/>Merefiri ha akɔ no na mewɔ biribiara nanso, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> de me aba fie nsapan. Adɛn enti na mofrɛ me Naomi wɔ ɛberɛ a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ama me ahunu amane na Otumfoɔ de saa abɛbrɛsɛ yi aba me so?”<verse eid="RUT 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 1:22"/>Enti, Naomi firi Moab baeɛ a, nʼase Rut, Moabni babunu ka ne ho. Wɔduruu Betlehem atokotwa berɛ ahyɛaseɛ no mu.<verse eid="RUT 1:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="RUT 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Rut Di Boas Afuo Mu Mpɛpɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 2:1"/>Ɔbarima ɔdefoɔ a na ɔyɛ okunini bi tenaa Betlehem a na wɔfrɛ no Boas. Na ɔyɛ Naomi kunu Elimelek busuani.<verse eid="RUT 2:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 2:2"/>Ɛda koro bi, Rut, Moabni, ka kyerɛɛ Naomi sɛ, “Ma menkɔ afuo mu na menkɔboaboa atokoɔ nkaseɛ na menni obi a ɔbɛma me adi nʼakyi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 2:2">Na Naomi kaa sɛ, “Ɛyɛ, me babaa, kɔ.” <verse eid="RUT 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 2:3"/>Enti, Rut kɔ kɔdii atwafoɔ no akyi. Na sɛdeɛ ɛbaeɛ ne sɛ, ɔhunuu sɛ ɔreyɛ adwuma wɔ Boas a ɔyɛ nʼase Elimelek busuani no afuo mu.<verse eid="RUT 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 2:4"/>Ɛberɛ a ɔwɔ hɔ no, Boas firi Betlehem baeɛ. Ɔkyeaa atwafoɔ no sɛ, “<char style="nd">Awurade</char> ne mo ntena!” Atwafoɔ no gyee so sɛ,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 2:4">“<char style="nd">Awurade</char> nhyira wo.”<verse eid="RUT 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 2:5"/>Ɛnna Boas bisaa ne sohwɛfoɔ sɛ, “Ababaawa bɛn na ɔwɔ nohoa hɔ no?”<verse eid="RUT 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 2:6"/>Sohwɛfoɔ no buaa sɛ, “Ɔyɛ ababaawa bi a ɔfiri Moab a ɔne Naomi baeɛ. <verse eid="RUT 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 2:7"/>Anɔpa yi ara na ɔbisaa me sɛ, ɔbɛtumi aboaboa atokoɔ ano adi atwafoɔ no akyi anaa. Ɔyɛ nsiyɛfoɔ a ɛberɛ kakra bi na ɔde homee wɔ pata no ase hɔ.”<verse eid="RUT 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 2:8"/>Boas kɔɔ hɔ kɔka kyerɛɛ Rut sɛ, “Me babaa tie. Wo ne yɛn ntena ha ara na boaboa atokoɔ; mma nkɔ afuo foforɔ biara mu. Di mmaa a wɔreyɛ adwuma wɔ mʼafuo yi mu no akyi pɛɛ. <verse eid="RUT 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 2:9"/>Hwɛ faako a wɔretwa wɔ afuo no mu na di wɔn akyi. Mabɔ mmeranteɛ no kɔkɔ sɛ wɔnnha wo. Na sɛ sukɔm de wo a, nom nsuo a wɔakɔsa afiri abura no mu no bi.”<verse eid="RUT 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 2:10"/>Rut butuiɛ, de nʼanim kyerɛɛ fam daa no ase. Na ɔkaa sɛ, “Adɛn enti na manya saa adom yi wɔ wʼani so, me a meyɛ ɔnanani yi?”<verse eid="RUT 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 2:11"/>Boas buaa sɛ, “Deɛ woayɛ ama wʼase ɛfiri wo kunu wuo akyi no nyinaa, wɔaka akyerɛ me, sɛ wofirii wʼagya ne wo maame ne wo ɔman na wo ne nnipa a wonnim wɔn baabiara no bɛtenaeɛ no. <verse eid="RUT 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 2:12"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Onyankopɔn a woanya dwanekɔbea wɔ ne ntaban ase no nnom wo.”<verse eid="RUT 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 2:13"/>Na ɔno nso kaa sɛ, “Ma menkɔ so nnya wʼanim adom daa, me wura. Woama me awerɛkyekyerɛ na woakasa akyerɛ wʼafenaa ayamyɛ so, me a mensɛ na memfata wo nnwumayɛfoɔ no mu baako mpo no.”<verse eid="RUT 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 2:14"/>Ɛduruu adidiberɛ no, Boas frɛɛ no sɛ, “Bra ma yɛnnidi. Wotumi de wo burodo no bɔ nsã biara a wopɛ mu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 2:14">Enti, ɔne nʼayutwafoɔ no tenaa ase na Boas maa no aduane sene sɛdeɛ ɔbɛtumi adi mpo. <verse eid="RUT 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 2:15"/>Ɛberɛ a Rut sane kɔɔ nʼadwuma so bio no, Boas ka kyerɛɛ ne mmeranteɛ no sɛ, “Momma no mmoaboa atokoɔ no ano mfiri nʼafiafi no mu na monnsi no kwan. <verse eid="RUT 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 2:16"/>Na monyiyi afiafi no mu deɛ no bi nnyae mu ngu fam mma no na ɔnsesa, na monnha no.”<verse eid="RUT 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 2:17"/>Enti, Rut sesaa atokoɔ no wɔ hɔ da mu no nyinaa na ɔporoo atokoɔ no saa anwummerɛ no, ɔnyaa bɛyɛ lita aduonu mmienu. <verse eid="RUT 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 2:18"/>Ɔsoa de kɔɔ kurom, de kɔkyerɛɛ nʼase. Afei, Rut de nʼawiaduane a ɔgya sii ne hɔ no maa no.<verse eid="RUT 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 2:19"/>Naomi hunuiɛ no, ɔteaam sɛ, “Ɛdɔɔso yie! Na ɛhe na ɛnnɛ woboaboaa saa atokoɔ yi nyinaa ano firi? Ɛhe na wokɔyɛɛ adwuma? <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nhyira deɛ ɔboaa wo no!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 2:19">Rut kaa ɔbarima a ɔyɛɛ adwuma wɔ nʼafuom no ho asɛm kyerɛɛ nʼase no, ɔtoaa so kaa sɛ, “Deɛ meyɛɛ adwuma wɔ nʼafuom no, wɔfrɛ no Boas.”<verse eid="RUT 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 2:20"/>Naomi ka kyerɛɛ nʼase no sɛ, “<char style="nd">Awurade</char> nhyira no. Ɔrekyerɛ yɛn ne wo kunu a wawuo no nʼayamyɛ. Saa ɔbarima no yɛ abusuafoɔ a wɔbɛn yɛn pɛɛ no mu baako a ɔyɛ abusua no mu ɔgyefoɔ baako.”<verse eid="RUT 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 2:21"/>Rut kaa sɛ, “Deɛ ɛka ho bio ne sɛ, mpo, Boas ka kyerɛɛ me sɛ, mensane mmra na me ne nʼatwafoɔ no mmɛtena kɔsi ɛberɛ a wɔbɛwie otwa no.”<verse eid="RUT 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 2:22"/>Naomi teaam sɛ, “Anwanwasɛm nie! Yɛ deɛ ɔka no. Wo ne nʼadwumayɛfoɔ no ntena kɔsi sɛ wɔbɛwie otwa no. Wʼasom bɛdwo wo wɔ hɔ sen afuo biara mu.”<verse eid="RUT 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="RUT 2:23"/>Enti, Rut ne mmaa a wɔwɔ Boas afuom hɔ no yɛɛ adwuma. Ɔne wɔn boaboaa atokoɔ no ano kɔsii atokotwa no awieeɛ. Afei, ɔne wɔn twaa ayuo nso. Nanso, saa ɛberɛ no nyinaa na ɔne nʼase na ɛte.<verse eid="RUT 2:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="RUT 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Rut Wɔ Ayuporobea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 3:1"/>Ɛda bi Naomi ka kyerɛɛ Rut sɛ, “Me babaa, ɛberɛ aduru sɛ mehwehwɛ fie a wobɛtena mu na wobɛnya deɛ ɛhia wo biara. <verse eid="RUT 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 3:2"/>Boas yɛ yɛn busuani pɛɛ na wayɛ adɔeɛ mmorosoɔ sɛ wama wo ne nʼadwumayɛfoɔ aboaboa atokoɔ ano. Anadwo yi, ɔbɛhuhu atokoɔ so wɔ ayuporobea hɔ. <verse eid="RUT 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 3:3"/>Enti, yɛ deɛ merekyerɛ wo yi. Dware na tutu aduhwam gu wo ho na fa wo ntadeɛ pa bi hyɛ. Afei, kɔ ayuporobea hɔ, nanso mma Boas nhunu wo kɔsi sɛ ɔbɛdidi awie. <verse eid="RUT 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 3:4"/>Hwɛ na hunu baabi a ɔda hɔ yie, afei, kɔ na kɔyi ne nan ho akatasoɔ na da hɔ. Ɔbɛka deɛ ɔpɛ sɛ woyɛ akyerɛ wo.”<verse eid="RUT 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 3:5"/>Rut kaa sɛ, “Biribiara a wobɛka akyerɛ me sɛ menyɛ no, mɛyɛ.” <verse eid="RUT 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 3:6"/>Enti, ɔkɔɔ ayuporobea hɔ anadwo no, na ɔdii akwankyerɛ a nʼase de maa no no so.<verse eid="RUT 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 3:7"/>Boas didi wieeɛ no a ne honhom aba ne ho no, ɔkyeaa ne ho too atokoɔ mmoano no ho, na ɔfaa mu daeɛ. Rut yɛɛ nwaa kɔyii ne nan ho akatasoɔ na ɔdaa hɔ. <verse eid="RUT 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 3:8"/>Anadwo dasuo mu no, Boas bɔɔ pitiri danee ne ho. Ɛyɛɛ no nwanwa sɛ ɔhunuu sɛ ɔbaa da ne nan ase.<verse eid="RUT 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 3:9"/>Ɔbisaa sɛ, “Na hwan nie?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 3:9">Ɔbuaa sɛ, “Ɛyɛ me wo ɔsomfoɔ Rut. Trɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Trɛ a obi trɛ nʼatadeɛ ano de gu ɔbaa so no kyerɛ awadeɛ ho banbɔ.</char></note> wo nkatasoɔ no mu kakra gu me so na woyɛ mʼabusua gyefoɔ.”<verse eid="RUT 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 3:10"/>Na Boas kaa sɛ, “<char style="nd">Awurade</char> nhyira wo, me babaa! Worekyerɛ abusua dɔ a ebi mmaa da sɛ woankɔdi aberantewaa bi akyi, sɛ ɔwɔ sika anaa ɔyɛ ohiani. <verse eid="RUT 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 3:11"/>Afei, me babaa, mma hwee nha wo. Mɛyɛ deɛ ɛho hia, ɛfiri sɛ, obiara a ɔwɔ kuro yi mu nim sɛ woyɛ ɔbaa a wodi wo ho ni. <verse eid="RUT 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 3:12"/>Nanso, akwansideɛ baako wɔ hɔ. Ɛyɛ nokorɛ turodoo sɛ meyɛ mo abusua agyefoɔ mu baako deɛ, nanso, ɔbarima foforɔ bi wɔ hɔ a ɔyɛ obusuani nimpɔn sene me. <verse eid="RUT 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 3:13"/>Tena ha anadwo yi na sɛ adeɛ kye a, me ne no bɛkasa. Sɛ ɛyɛ ne pɛ sɛ ɔbɛgye wo a, ɛnneɛ ma ho kwan na ɔnware wo. Na sɛ ɛnyɛ ne pɛ nso a, ɛnneɛ, ɛkwan biara so, sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> te ase yi, mɛware wo! Enti da ha ma adeɛ nkye.”<verse eid="RUT 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 3:14"/>Enti, Rut daa ne nan ho kɔsii adekyeeɛ nanso ɔsɔree ɛberɛ a na anim ayɛ hwanihwani no. Na Boas ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Ɛnsɛ sɛ obi hunu sɛ ɔbaa bi bɛdaa ayuporeeɛ ha.”<verse eid="RUT 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 3:15"/>Boas toaa so kaa sɛ, “Fa wʼatadeɛ ngugusoɔ no bra na trɛ mu.” Ɔsesaa atokoɔ no susukora nsia guu mu na ɔboaa no maa ɔde hyɛɛ nʼakyi. Na Boas sane kɔɔ kuro no mu.<verse eid="RUT 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 3:16"/>Rut baa nʼase Naomi nkyɛn no, ɔbisaa no sɛ, “Me babaa, ɛkɔsii sɛn?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 3:16">Rut kaa biribiara a Boas yɛ maa no kyerɛɛ Naomi, <verse eid="RUT 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 3:17"/>na ɔtoaa so sɛ, “Ɔmaa me atokoɔ susukora nsia kaa sɛ, ‘Mfa nsapan nkɔ wʼase nkyɛn.’ ”<verse eid="RUT 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 3:18"/>Afei, Naomi kaa sɛ, “Me ba, twɛn kɔsi sɛ wobɛhunu deɛ ɛbɛsi. Ɔbarima no renna so kɔsi sɛ ɔbɛwie dwumadie no. Ɔbɛma asi ɛnnɛ dua yi ara.”<verse eid="RUT 3:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="RUT 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Boas Ware Rut</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 4:1"/>Boas kɔɔ kuro no ɛpono ano kɔtenaa ase wɔ hɔ. Ɛberɛ a obusuani gyefoɔ nimpɔn a ɔkaa ne ho asɛm no baa hɔ no, Boas frɛɛ no kaa sɛ, “Mʼadamfo, mesrɛ wo bra na mepɛ sɛ me ne wo twetwe nkɔmmɔ.” Enti, wɔtenaa ase.<verse eid="RUT 4:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 4:2"/>Na Boas frɛɛ kuro no mu ntuanofoɔ edu sɛ wɔmmɛtena ase sɛ adansefoɔ. <verse eid="RUT 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 4:3"/>Na Boas ka kyerɛɛ obusuani gyefoɔ nimpɔn no sɛ, “Wonim Naomi a ɔfiri Moab baeɛ no. Ɔretɔn asase a na ɛyɛ yɛn busuani Elimelek dea no. <verse eid="RUT 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 4:4"/>Mesusu sɛ, ɛsɛ sɛ, me ne wo di ho nkɔmmɔ na sɛ wopɛ a, woagye. Sɛ wopɛ asase no a, tɔ no ha yi ara wɔ saa adansefoɔ yi anim. Na sɛ wompɛ nso a, ma mente no seesei ara, ɛfiri sɛ, sɛ woantumi annye a, me ne onipa a medi wʼakyi wɔ abusua no mu a ɛsɛ sɛ megye.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 4:4">Na ɔbarima no buaa sɛ, “Mɛgye.”<verse eid="RUT 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 4:5"/>Afei, Boas ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Sɛ wotɔ asase no firi Naomi nkyɛn a, na ɛsɛ sɛ woware Moabni okunafoɔ Rut no. Sɛ ɛba saa a, ɔbɛwo mma a ne kunu din bɛda wɔn so na asase no bɛtena abusua no mu.”<verse eid="RUT 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 4:6"/>Ɛhɔ ara na abusua mu gyefoɔ nimpɔn no kaa sɛ, “Ɛnneɛ merentumi ntɔ asase no, ɛfiri sɛ, ɛbɛha mʼagyapadeɛ. Tɔ asase no na merentumi ntɔ.”<verse eid="RUT 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 4:7"/>Saa ɛberɛ no, na ɛyɛ Israel amanneɛ sɛ, sɛ obiara redane nʼadeɛ bi a watɔ no ɛkwan pa so ama obi foforɔ a, ɔworɔ ne mpaboa de ma ɔtɔfoɔ no. Wɔyɛ saa wɔ badwa mu de hyɛ adetɔ no mu den. <verse eid="RUT 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 4:8"/>Enti, abusua gyefoɔ nimpɔn no worɔɔ ne mpaboa ka kyerɛɛ Boas sɛ, “Wo ara tɔ asase no.”<verse eid="RUT 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 4:9"/>Na Boas ka kyerɛɛ ɔman no ntuanofoɔ no ne ɛdɔm a wɔatwa ahyia hɔ no sɛ, “Ɛnnɛ matɔ Elimelek, Kilion ne Mahlon agyapadeɛ a ɛwɔ Naomi nsam, na moyɛ ɛho adansefoɔ. <verse eid="RUT 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 4:10"/>Menam asase no tɔ so afa Rut a ɔyɛ Moabni a ɔyɛ Mahlon kunafoɔ no sɛ me yere. Ɛno enti, sɛ ɔwo ɔbabarima a, ɔbɛfa ne kunu a wawu no abusua din na wafa abusua agyapadeɛ a ɛwɔ ne kurom ha nso. Ɛnnɛ, mo nyinaa moyɛ adansefoɔ.”<verse eid="RUT 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 4:11"/>Afei, ntuanofoɔ no ne ɔmanfoɔ no nyinaa sɔre gyinaeɛ kaa sɛ, “Yɛyɛ adansefoɔ! <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mmoa mma ɔbaa a afei na ɔreba wo fie no nyɛ sɛ Rahel ne Lea<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Israelfoɔ nyinaa ase firi Rahel ne Lea mu. Saa ara na Dawid ne Agyenkwa no yɛ Rut asefoɔ.</char></note> a wɔn mu na Israel aman nyinaa firi no. Wobɛyɛ kɛse wɔ Efrata na woagye edin wɔ Betlehem. <verse eid="RUT 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 4:12"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mfa ababaawa yi so mma wo asefoɔ a wɔbɛyɛ sɛ yɛn agya Peres<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Na Peres yɛ Boas aseni (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 1:3">Mat 1.3</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:33">Luk 3.33</ref></char>).</char></note> a ɔyɛ Tamar ne Yuda babarima no.”<verse eid="RUT 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Boas Asefoɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 4:13"/>Enti, Boas waree Rut de no kɔɔ ne fie. Afei, ɔkɔɔ ne ho na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ma ɔnyinsɛnee na ɔwoo ɔbabarima. <verse eid="RUT 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 4:14"/>Na kuro no mu mmaa ka kyerɛɛ Naomi sɛ, “Animuonyam nka <char style="nd">Awurade</char> sɛ ɛnnɛ ɛda yi, wama woanya abusua gyefoɔ! Ɔmmɛyɛ okunini wɔ Israel. <verse eid="RUT 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 4:15"/>Akokoaa yi mma wo nsi wo mmabaawaberɛ mu na ɔnhwɛ wo wɔ wo mmerewabɔ mu. Ɛfiri sɛ ɔyɛ wʼase a ɔdɔ wo na ɔsene mmammarima nson ma wo no babarima.”<verse eid="RUT 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 4:16"/>Na Naomi faa akɔkoaa no, na ɔhwɛɛ no te sɛ ɔno ankasa yafunu ba. <verse eid="RUT 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 4:17"/>Na mmaa a wɔne no bɔ fipam kaa sɛ, “Afei deɛ Naomi anya ɔbabarima bio.” Na wɔtoo no din Obed. Ɔno na ɔbɛyɛɛ Yisai agya ne Dawid nana.<verse eid="RUT 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 4:18"/>Tete agya Peres awoɔ ntoatoasoɔ nie:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="RUT 4:18"/>
  <para style="li1" vid="RUT 4:18">Peres woo Hesron.<verse eid="RUT 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 4:19"/>Hesron woo Ram,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="RUT 4:19">ɛnna Ram woo Aminadab.<verse eid="RUT 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 4:20"/>Aminadab woo Nahson,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="RUT 4:20">ɛnna Nahson woo Salmon.<verse eid="RUT 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 4:21"/>Salmon woo Boas,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="RUT 4:21">ɛnna Boas woo Obed.<verse eid="RUT 4:21"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 4:22"/>Obed woo Yisai,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="RUT 4:22">ɛnna Yisai woo Dawid.<verse eid="RUT 4:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 4"/>
</usx>
